---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
  title={`Terms of Use · ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description="Terms of use for Wealth Sim."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-sans text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 2026-10-04</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">1. What Wealth Sim is</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          Wealth Sim is a financial-literacy simulation and education tool. It shows you what a
          rich person\u2019s balance sheet and bills look like, and it calculates your own
          saving path from the assumptions you enter.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">2. Not financial advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          Everything the tool produces is a static arithmetic projection of the assumptions you
          entered. It is not investment, career, tax, legal, or financial advice, and it is not a
          prediction of any future outcome. Do not make major decisions based solely on these
          results.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">3. No product recommendations</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          Wealth Sim does not recommend, endorse, or sell any specific financial product. Paid
          tiers unlock more complete models and retention features only.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">4. Illustrative figures</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          Persona asset structures and holding costs come from public sources and reasonable
          estimates. They are used to explain structure and are not real quotes, offers, or
          price lists.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">5. Data</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          Your scenarios are stored locally in your browser. We do not hold, sell, or share your
          financial inputs. See the Privacy Policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">6. No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          The tool is provided \u201cas is\u201d without warranties of any kind. Figures may
          contain errors or become outdated. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable
          for decisions made using these results.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">7. Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          We may update these terms as the product evolves. Continued use after changes means you
          accept the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
